            description: 'The Golden City — rising from the heart of the Thar Desert, Jaisalmer\'s honey-coloured sandstone fort is one of the world\'s last living forts, still inhabited by a quarter of the city\'s population. A land of camel safaris, sand dunes, and hauntingly beautiful havelis.',
            lat: 26.9157,
